name: Budgeted catalog drafts require review, exact-source acceptance and immutable scan references
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_AGENT_MCPS
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/taint_catalog.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: setg ui.auto_open_viz false
submit: logs
submit: run taint-iris-next:catalog-read
require-live-snap: 25 Saved taint catalog | legacy-catalog
paste-file: @ART/unbound-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 approved investigation allowance | unbound-refused
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/taint_catalog.py @TMP_TARGET @ART unbound
paste-file: @ART/approval-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 REVIEW ALLOWANCE | allowance
expect: Total provider calls: 2
expect: Protected review calls: 0
resize: 160x48
live-snap: allowance-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: allowance-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: allowance-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: allowance-60x20
resize: 40x12
keys: End
require-live-snap: 20 y approve | allowance-40x12
ask: Does the allowance clearly cover only two separately invoked intercepted Context requests with unknown dollars, no protected Review capacity and no follow-up scans?
keys: y
resize: 120x36
require-live-snap: 25 Allowance approved | allowance-approved
paste-file: @ART/invalid-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 Catalog draft failed | invalid-model-output
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/taint_catalog.py @TMP_TARGET @ART invalid
paste-file: @ART/generate-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 Taint catalog draft: | partial-draft
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/taint_catalog.py @TMP_TARGET @ART generated
paste-file: @ART/summary-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Taint catalog draft: | draft-summary
nav-mode:
keys: z
require-live-snap: 20 READ TRANSCRIPT | draft-reader
resize: 160x48
live-snap: draft-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: draft-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: draft-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: draft-60x20
resize: 40x12
keys: End
live-snap: draft-40x12-tail
keys: PPage
live-snap: draft-40x12-page-1
keys: PPage
live-snap: draft-40x12-page-2
keys: PPage
live-snap: draft-40x12-page-3
keys: PPage
live-snap: draft-40x12-page-4
keys: PPage
live-snap: draft-40x12-page-5
keys: PPage
live-snap: draft-40x12-page-6
ask: Is this visibly a source-grounded draft with partial coverage and priority zero, distinct from an accepted catalog, vulnerability finding or completed Map?
keys: q
resize: 120x36
keys: Escape C-u
paste-file: @ART/inputs-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Frozen catalog inputs | supplied-inputs
nav-mode:
keys: z
require-live-snap: 20 READ TRANSCRIPT | frozen-input-reader
resize: 160x48
live-snap: inputs-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: inputs-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: inputs-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: inputs-60x20
resize: 40x12
keys: End
live-snap: inputs-40x12-tail
keys: PPage
live-snap: inputs-reading-01-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: inputs-reading-02-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: inputs-reading-03-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: inputs-reading-04-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: inputs-reading-05-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: inputs-reading-06-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: inputs-reading-07-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: inputs-reading-08-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: inputs-reading-09-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: inputs-reading-10-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: inputs-reading-11-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: inputs-reading-12-40x12
ask: Are the exact frozen source prefix, omitted context and system instructions readable at all six sizes while historical source freshness stays unverified?
keys: q
resize: 120x36
keys: Escape C-u
paste-file: @ART/no-ack-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 ⚠ CONFIRM · descriptor-declared effect | partial-acceptance-confirmation
keys: End y
require-live-snap: 25 acknowledgePartial | missing-partial-ack
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/taint_catalog.py @TMP_TARGET @ART no-ack
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/taint_catalog.py @TMP_TARGET @ART drift
paste-file: @ART/accept-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 ⚠ CONFIRM · descriptor-declared effect | changed-source-confirmation
keys: End y
require-live-snap: 25 Source changed since catalog generation | source-drift-refused
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/taint_catalog.py @TMP_TARGET @ART drift-refused
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/taint_catalog.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restore
paste-file: @ART/accept-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 ⚠ CONFIRM · descriptor-declared effect | exact-acceptance
expect: acknowledged: true
expect: This starts no model request or scan
ask: Does acceptance identify the actual target, exact draft and partial-context acknowledgement before replacement, with no model request or scan authorized?
keys: End y
require-live-snap: 25 Taint catalog accepted | accepted
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/taint_catalog.py @TMP_TARGET @ART accepted
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/taint_catalog.py @TMP_TARGET @ART edit-active
submit: run taint-iris-next:catalog-read
require-live-snap: 25 Saved taint catalog is unreadable | intervening-edit
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/taint_catalog.py @TMP_TARGET @ART unreadable
paste-file: @ART/pinned-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Saved taint catalog | retained-pin
paste-file: @ART/replace-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 ⚠ CONFIRM · descriptor-declared effect | reviewed-replacement
expect: Expected active catalog
keys: End y
require-live-snap: 25 Taint catalog accepted | replaced-without-regeneration
paste-file: @ART/exhausted-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 allowance exhausted: 2 calls committed | exhausted
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/taint_catalog.py @TMP_TARGET @ART exhausted
ask: Can the operator read an immutable accepted profile and explicitly repair an intervening active edit after call capacity is exhausted, without paid regeneration or a fallback scan?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 15
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: logs
submit: run campaign:allowance {"investigationId":"owned-taint-catalog"}
require-live-snap: 25 Calls committed: 2/2 | restarted-accounting
paste-file: @ART/pinned-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Saved taint catalog | restarted-pinned-profile
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/taint_catalog.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
resize: 40x12
nav-mode:
keys: z
require-live-snap: 20 READ TRANSCRIPT | no-color-reader
keys: End
live-snap: no-color-40x12-tail
keys: PPage
live-snap: no-color-40x12-page-1
keys: PPage
live-snap: no-color-40x12-page-2
keys: PPage
live-snap: no-color-40x12-page-3
ask: Does no-color restart retain the accepted catalog reference, exhausted two-request history and keyboard access without inferring current source freshness?
keys: q C-c
require-exit: 15
